"""The judgement column of docs/mechanics/gh-to-fh-map.md: for every key Gloomhaven's cards use, what Frosthaven has for
it and what a port must do. Hand-written (2026-10-27) over the inventory tools/mechanics.py computes; the facts behind
each verdict are the counts in that inventory, Frosthaven's decompiled rule library (AbilityData.ParseAbilityProperties,
the CAbility* classes, ESpecificPropType, EFilterTargetType) and the 2026-10-27 effects pass, in which every half of the
five ported classes (Brute, Scoundrel, Sunkeeper, Sawbones, Quartermaster) showed its effect in Frosthaven.

Verdicts:  same       - Frosthaven's own cards use it the same way; a straight copy
           verified   - no Frosthaven card uses it, but a ported class does and the effects pass saw it work
           check      - Frosthaven's parser and code keep it, no card of its own uses it: confirm in game before the
                        class that needs it ships (UI, trackers, animation, co-op)
           plugin     - Frosthaven's reader drops or lacks it: the plugin must supply it (or the card is redesigned)
           decision   - Frosthaven can't run it as written; the port changed the card by decision (gh_port CARD_FIXES)
           cosmetic   - presentation only
"""

